 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "Main path",
   "items": [
    "The UI only subscribes: runs belong to the gateway, so refreshing or backgrounding never cuts them",
    "Each conversation can use its own model and provider, running side by side",
    "Claude Code is the official build, not a byte changed",
    "Tool calls that need approval show a card: ask each time by default, as upstream does"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Security",
   "items": [
    "Gateway /api/* requires a 256-bit token and checks Host and Origin",
    "Sign-in is the official flow: the code is pasted to claude in the terminal, never through the gateway",
    "priv accepts only this app's uid; device tools (an MCP server for Claude) are off by default, and the user confirms before another app opens"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Toolchain & packages",
   "items": [
    "devkit is assembled from the official Termux repos and relocated with equal-length prefixes; extras install as modules",
    "Two APKs, targetSdk 28 and 36 — same version and signature, either installs over the other",
    "The 36 build can't exec files in its data dir: programs start via the APK's own ld.so or linker64"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Components",
   "items": [
    "One component = new commands + a skill: Claude learns to use them on its own",
    "Community recipes may only use official Termux packages or upstream files pinned by sha256",
    "The app only trusts an ed25519-signed index, which lists every package's sha256"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
